  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "To calculate the area $A$ of a square, we square its side length. Therefore, the area of the square is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =(12\\,\\text{in})^{2} \\\\  & =12\\,\\text{in}\\times 12\\,\\text{in} \\\\  & =(12\\times 12)\\times (\\text{in}\\times \\text{in}) \\\\  & =144\\,{\\text{in}}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
